### Try the API from VS Code: install "REST Client", then click "Send Request" above each block.
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health check (is SQL Server reachable?)
GET {{base}}/health

### Create an account (the session cookie is kept for the requests below)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Demo User", "pin": "2580", "backupPin": "7391" }

### Sign in
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Demo User", "pin": "2580" }

### Forgot PIN: use the backup PIN to set a new one
POST {{base}}/auth/reset-pin
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Demo User", "backupPin": "7391", "newPin": "3692" }

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### Add a transaction
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Salary", "category": "Salary", "type": "Income", "amount": 50000, "transactionDate": "2026-11-01" }

### List (all filters optional)
GET {{base}}/transactions?start=2026-01-01&end=2026-12-31&type=Income

### Monthly totals for the chart
GET {{base}}/transactions/summary?from=2026-06-01

### Update transaction 1
PUT {{base}}/transactions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Salary (Nov)", "category": "Salary", "type": "Income", "amount": 52000, "transactionDate": "2026-11-01" }

### Delete transaction 1
DELETE {{base}}/transactions/1

### Sign out
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
